        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-292817-292838"><rb>常陸</rb><rt>ひたち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-292838-292859"><rb>真壁</rb><rt>まかべ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-292859-292868">郡中村</seg><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-292868-292922"><seg source="#source-292868-292874">大字</seg></hi><seg source="#source-292922-292925">林</seg><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-292925-292973"><seg source="#source-292925-292928">字</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-292973-292994"><rb>土深</rb><rt>どぶ</rt></ruby></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-292996-293011">同　同　　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-293011-293029"><rb>騰波</rb><rt>とば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-293029-293032">ノ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-293032-293044"><rb>江</rb><rt>え</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-293044-293047">村</seg><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-293047-293101"><seg source="#source-293047-293053">大字</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-293101-293134"><rb>筑波島</rb><rt>つくはしま</rt></ruby><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-293134-293182"><seg source="#source-293134-293137">字</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-293182-293203"><rb>土腐</rb><rt>どぶ</rt></ruby></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-293205-293226"><rb>磐城</rb><rt>いわき</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-293226-293247"><rb>双葉</rb><rt>ふたば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-293247-293250">郡</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-293250-293280"><rb>幾世橋</rb><rt>きよはし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-293280-293283">村</seg><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-293283-293337"><seg source="#source-293283-293289">大字</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-293337-293364"><rb>棚塩</rb><rt>たなしお</rt></ruby><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-293364-293412"><seg source="#source-293364-293367">字</seg></hi><seg source="#source-293412-293426">ドブ谷地</seg></p>
